COMMENT ON TABLE facility.operation IS 'Module-local long-running operation record of the facility module, returned by its async API calls; polled by clients until it finishes.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN facility.operation.id IS 'Surrogate primary key (UUIDv7 generated by the application; database default is a v4 fallback).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN facility.operation.tenant_id IS 'Owning tenant (customer organisation). Row-level security key.';
